{"content_hash": "391762bec32376f7", "version_id": 775, "article_id": 78, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Jokić tells booing Nuggets fans to stay away after 23-point comeback", "title_zh": "约基奇怒怼嘘声球迷：别再来看了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/jokic-says-booing-fans-not-welcome-after-nuggets-rally-from-23-points-down-to-beat-pelicans", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722653-c611b7f78c32?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGpva2klMjBib29pbmclMjBmYW5zfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTI5NzA4NDV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-in-blue-and-white-uniform-on-stadium-_zukO8E8-bY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(325, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(3, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "219d721cfe25"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-26", "word_count": 268, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Nikola Jokić delivered a blunt message to Denver fans who booed the Nuggets at halftime: don't bother coming back. His team then produced a stirring rally to beat New Orleans in overtime.", "lead_zh": "尼古拉·约基奇对半场嘘主队的掘金球迷放了狠话：以后别来了。随后球队上演大逆转，加时击败新奥尔良。", "preview": "Jokić poured in 35 points, including eight in overtime, and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as a depleted Denver side overturned a 23-point", "preview_zh": "约基奇砍下35分，其中加时独得8分，另有15个篮板和10次助攻，带领人手短缺的掘金在周六晚完成23分大逆转，以141比135险胜新奥尔良鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 755, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 109.675, "size_bytes": 658944, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 319, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 112.875, "size_bytes": 678240, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 319, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 120.125, "size_bytes": 721728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 319, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 103.525, "size_bytes": 622080, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 319, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 112.975, "size_bytes": 678816, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 319, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/78/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@146f373/content/data/versions/775.json", "paragraphs": ["Jokić poured in 35 points, including eight in overtime, and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as a depleted Denver side overturned a 23-point deficit to edge the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was the 199th regular-season triple-double of his career, leaving him second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.", "Sections of the home crowd made their displeasure plain when Denver trudged into halftime trailing 73-57. Jokić was unsparing afterwards. \"We got booed at our first home game, and I think those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said, adding that anyone who follows the team knows it never quits and has clawed back from far worse.", "Jamal Murray top-scored with 42 points, while rookie Trevon Brazille marked his home debut with 17, seven of them in overtime. His corner three with 1:25 remaining put Denver 133-129 up. The Nuggets were without Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo, and remain without Julian Strawther and Spencer Jones.", "Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, Dejounte Murray added 22, and Derik Queen and Zion Williamson chipped in 17 apiece. The Pelicans, who shot a scorching 65.9% in the first half, have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.", "Denver whittled the gap to 16 by the break, then saw Jokić and Murray combine for 22 of the team's 32 third-quarter points, only for New Orleans to restore a 19-point cushion entering the fourth. Threes from the pair, plus a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, erased the deficit, and Murray's two late free throws forced overtime."], "paragraphs_zh": ["约基奇砍下35分，其中加时独得8分，另有15个篮板和10次助攻，带领人手短缺的掘金在周六晚完成23分大逆转，以141比135险胜新奥尔良鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。", "当掘金半场以57比73落后、球员垂头走回更衣室时，部分主场球迷毫不掩饰不满。约基奇赛后毫不留情：“我们第一个主场比赛就被嘘了，我觉得那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用再来了。”他还说，真正关注球队的人都清楚，掘金从不放弃，也曾从更糟的处境中翻盘。", "贾马尔·穆雷拿下全场最高的42分，新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔主场首秀贡献17分，其中7分来自加时。终场前1分25秒，他在底角命中三分，帮助掘金以133比129领先。掘金此役缺少卡姆·约翰逊和阿尔法·迪亚洛，朱利安·斯特劳瑟和斯宾塞·琼斯也继续缺阵。", "鹈鹕方面，特雷·墨菲三世得到26分，德章泰·穆雷添上22分，德里克·奎因和锡安·威廉森各得17分。上半场投篮命中率高达65.9%的鹈鹕，在菜鸟主帅贾马尔·莫斯利麾下已遭遇开局三连败。", "掘金在半场结束前将分差缩小到16分，第三节约基奇与穆雷包办了全队32分中的22分，但鹈鹕带着19分优势进入末节。随后两人接连命中三分，阿隆·戈登又献上一记反手扣篮，掘金抹平分差，穆雷最后时刻两罚全中，将比赛拖入加时。"], "body": "Jokić poured in 35 points, including eight in overtime, and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as a depleted Denver side overturned a 23-point deficit to edge the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was the 199th regular-season triple-double of his career, leaving him second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\n\nSections of the home crowd made their displeasure plain when Denver trudged into halftime trailing 73-57. Jokić was unsparing afterwards. \"We got booed at our first home game, and I think those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said, adding that anyone who follows the team knows it never quits and has clawed back from far worse.\n\nJamal Murray top-scored with 42 points, while rookie Trevon Brazille marked his home debut with 17, seven of them in overtime. His corner three with 1:25 remaining put Denver 133-129 up. The Nuggets were without Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo, and remain without Julian Strawther and Spencer Jones.\n\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, Dejounte Murray added 22, and Derik Queen and Zion Williamson chipped in 17 apiece. The Pelicans, who shot a scorching 65.9% in the first half, have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.\n\nDenver whittled the gap to 16 by the break, then saw Jokić and Murray combine for 22 of the team's 32 third-quarter points, only for New Orleans to restore a 19-point cushion entering the fourth. Threes from the pair, plus a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, erased the deficit, and Murray's two late free throws forced overtime.", "body_zh": "约基奇砍下35分，其中加时独得8分，另有15个篮板和10次助攻，带领人手短缺的掘金在周六晚完成23分大逆转，以141比135险胜新奥尔良鹈鹕。这是他常规赛生涯第199次三双，仅次于退役时拿到209次的拉塞尔·威斯布鲁克。\n\n当掘金半场以57比73落后、球员垂头走回更衣室时，部分主场球迷毫不掩饰不满。约基奇赛后毫不留情：“我们第一个主场比赛就被嘘了，我觉得那些嘘我们的球迷，以后不用再来了。”他还说，真正关注球队的人都清楚，掘金从不放弃，也曾从更糟的处境中翻盘。\n\n贾马尔·穆雷拿下全场最高的42分，新秀特雷冯·布拉齐尔主场首秀贡献17分，其中7分来自加时。终场前1分25秒，他在底角命中三分，帮助掘金以133比129领先。掘金此役缺少卡姆·约翰逊和阿尔法·迪亚洛，朱利安·斯特劳瑟和斯宾塞·琼斯也继续缺阵。\n\n鹈鹕方面，特雷·墨菲三世得到26分，德章泰·穆雷添上22分，德里克·奎因和锡安·威廉森各得17分。上半场投篮命中率高达65.9%的鹈鹕，在菜鸟主帅贾马尔·莫斯利麾下已遭遇开局三连败。\n\n掘金在半场结束前将分差缩小到16分，第三节约基奇与穆雷包办了全队32分中的22分，但鹈鹕带着19分优势进入末节。随后两人接连命中三分，阿隆·戈登又献上一记反手扣篮，掘金抹平分差，穆雷最后时刻两罚全中，将比赛拖入加时。", "text": "Jokić poured in 35 points, including eight in overtime, and added 15 rebounds and 10 assists as a depleted Denver side overturned a 23-point deficit to edge the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night. It was the 199th regular-season triple-double of his career, leaving him second only to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209. Sections of the home crowd made their displeasure plain when Denver trudged into halftime trailing 73-57. Jokić was unsparing afterwards. \"We got booed at our first home game, and I think those fans who booed us, they don't need to come anymore,\" he said, adding that anyone who follows the team knows it never quits and has clawed back from far worse. Jamal Murray top-scored with 42 points, while rookie Trevon Brazille marked his home debut with 17, seven of them in overtime. His corner three with 1:25 remaining put Denver 133-129 up. The Nuggets were without Cam Johnson and Alpha Diallo, and remain without Julian Strawther and Spencer Jones. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, Dejounte Murray added 22, and Derik Queen and Zion Williamson chipped in 17 apiece. The Pelicans, who shot a scorching 65.9% in the first half, have now lost their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley. Denver whittled the gap to 16 by the break, then saw Jokić and Murray combine for 22 of the team's 32 third-quarter points, only for New Orleans to restore a 19-point cushion entering the fourth. Threes from the pair, plus a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, erased the deficit, and Murray's two late free throws forced overtime.", "vocab": [{"word": "depleted", "pos": "adj", "zh": "人手短缺的，被削弱的", "note": "常形容阵容、资源因缺人而吃紧", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overturn a deficit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "扭转落后局面", "note": "体育报道常用，deficit 指分差", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "edge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "险胜", "note": "edge sb 比分接近地击败对手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "triple-double", "pos": "noun", "zh": "三双", "note": "篮球术语，三项数据上双", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unsparing", "pos": "adj", "zh": "毫不留情的", "note": "be unsparing in/about sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "make one's displeasure plain", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "明确表达不满", "note": "正式书面表达，比 show anger 更克制", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trudge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "拖着步子走", "note": "常暗示疲惫、沮丧", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "claw back", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "奋力追回", "note": "claw back from a deficit 追分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chip in", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "贡献，添上", "note": "口语，指各得若干分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "scorching", "pos": "adj", "zh": "火热的，惊人的", "note": "形容命中率、状态极佳", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "whittle", "pos": "verb", "zh": "逐渐削减", "note": "whittle the gap/deficit 缩小分差", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cushion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "领先优势", "note": "a 19-point cushion 19分领先", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "erase the deficit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "抹平分差", "note": "与 overturn 近义，更强调追平", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "top-score", "pos": "verb", "zh": "得分最高", "note": "英式体育用语，也可作 top-scorer", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jokić says booing fans ‘not welcome’ after Nuggets rally from 23 points down to beat Pelicans", "summary_original": "New Orleans Pelicans 135-141 Denver Nuggets (OT)\nNuggets fans showed displeasure at half-time\nNikola Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and finished with 15 rebounds and 10 assists, and the short-handed Denver Nuggets rallied from 23 points down to beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night.\nJokić had his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Jokić says booing fans ‘not welcome’ after Nuggets rally from 23 points down to beat Pelicans\nNew Orleans Pelicans 135-141 Denver Nuggets (OT)\nNuggets fans showed displeasure at half-time\nNikola Jokić scored eight of his 35 points in overtime and finished with 15 rebounds and 10 assists, and the short-handed Denver Nuggets rallied from 23 points down to beat the New Orleans Pelicans 141-135 on Saturday night.\nJokić had his 199th career triple-double in the regular season, second to Russell Westbrook, who retired with 209.\nSections of the Nuggets home crowd booed the team when they went into half-time 73-57 down. After the game, Jokić made his displeasure clear.\n“We got booed at our first home game, and I think those fans who booed us, they don’t need to come anymore,” Jokić said. “If you guys follow us, you know that we never quit and we’ve come back from much worse situations. So, if they ask me, they are not welcome anymore.”\nJamal Murray scored 42 points and rookie Trevon Brazille had seven of his 17 points in overtime in his home debut for Denver, which took an early lead in overtime. His corner three-pointer with 1:25 left in overtime gave the Nuggets a 133-129 lead.\nDenver played without Cam Johnson (ankle) and Alpha Diallo (sprained wrist) and continued to be without Julian Strawther and Spencer Jones.\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points, Dejounte Murray had 22 points and Derik Queen and Zion Williamson scored 17 each. The Pelicans have dropped their first three games under first-year coach Jamahl Mosley.\nNew Orleans shot 65.9% in the first half and led by 23. Denver rallied to cut it to 16, and Jokić and Murray combined to score 22 of the Nuggets’ 32 points in the third quarter but the Pelicans extended the lead to 19 heading into the fourth.\nDenver erased the deficit on three-pointers from Murray and Jokić, a reverse dunk from Aaron Gordon, and then had a chance to go ahead with 17 seconds left but Murray made two of three free throws to tie it.\nExplore more on these topics\nNBA\nNikola Jokić\nBasketball\nUS sports\nnews\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-25T23:27:24.188772", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Joki", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.63, "sm": 300, "em": 629, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "ć", "s": 0.63, "e": 0.712, "sm": 629, "em